title: "Arbogast: certificate-first finite exact computational mathematics"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-29
authors:
  - name: azide0x37
repository-code: "https://github.com/azide0x37/arbogast"
url: "https://github.com/azide0x37/arbogast"
keywords:
  - computational mathematics
  - cohomology
  - finite groups
  - Hurwitz spaces
  - number fields
  - Selmer groups
  - certificates
abstract: >-
  Arbogast is a certificate-first computational mathematics library for finite exact
  cohomology, pinned number-field arithmetic, finite Kummer and 2-Selmer problems, symmetry,
  and Hurwitz arithmetic. It separates discovery from verification and records mathematical
  results in provenance-preserving claim graphs.
